(slower-x8-sv03-racetrack-altitude-turns-direct-wrench-6dof)
*title Skywalker X8 powered racetrack induced-wrench rigid-body realization
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*runtime status vehicle reference-area=0.75 reference-length=0.36 dry-mass-kg=3.364 inertia-x=0.325 inertia-y=0.140 inertia-z=0.400 envelope-min-forward-speed=2 envelope-max-speed=27 envelope-max-alpha-deg=12 envelope-max-beta-deg=5
*runtime status target latitude-deg=0.0 longitude-deg=0.0 altitude-m=178.0
*runtime status route mode=racetrack start-latitude-deg=0.0 start-longitude-deg=0.0 duration-s=165.9662752399384 racetrack-length-m=700 racetrack-turn-radius-m=250 racetrack-speed-mps=17.9 racetrack-low-altitude-m=178 racetrack-high-altitude-m=188 racetrack-climb-rate-mps=0.5 racetrack-descent-rate-mps=0.3 racetrack-left-bank-deg=-8 racetrack-right-bank-deg=-8 racetrack-coordinated-turn=false racetrack-altitude-capture-gain-per-s=0.1 racetrack-altitude-capture-max-mps=2 position-capture-gain=0.01 position-capture-max-correction-mps=2
*runtime status guidance propnav-gain=0.0 racetrack-coordinated-turn=false max-pitch-deg=8 fixed-wing-alpha-command-deg=7.8095001441044465 fixed-wing-beta-command-deg=0.5875897839477 fixed-wing-control-authority=direct-moment attitude-gain=200.0 rate-damping=50.0 body-rate-damping-nm-s-per-rad=0.1
*runtime status actuator maximum-moment=20 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=180
*runtime control throttle vehicle=1 default=0.5773431905510489 lower=0 upper=1
*define x8-cx
  x8-cx=(cx-static)+(cx-collective)-(cx-static)+(cx-differential)-(cx-static);
*define x8-cy
  x8-cy=(cy-static)+(cy-collective)-(cy-static)+(cy-differential)-(cy-static);
*define x8-cz
  x8-cz=(cz-static)+(cz-collective)-(cz-static)+(cz-differential)-(cz-static);
*define x8-cmx
  x8-cmx=(cmx-static)+(cmx-collective)-(cmx-static)+(cmx-differential)-(cmx-static);
*define x8-cmy
  x8-cmy=(cmy-static)+(cmy-collective)-(cmy-static)+(cmy-differential)-(cmy-static);
*define x8-cmz
  x8-cmz=(cmz-static)+(cmz-collective)-(cmz-static)+(cmz-differential)-(cmz-static);
*trajectory 1 x8 start on 1
  *initial ecic x=6378315.0 y=0.0 z=0.0 xdt=0.499973707044 ydt=17.89301613164 zdt=-0.00007162471 qw=0.542086857692 qx=-0.536555865662 qy=-0.459640551982 qz=0.454950771749 time=0.0 mass=3.364 propellant_mass=0.0
  *segment 1 racetrack-altitude-turns
    *integ dtprnt=0.2 dt=0.02
    *prop thrust=(thrust) mdot=0
    *aero cx=x8-cx cy=x8-cy cz=x8-cz cmx=x8-cmx cmy=x8-cmy cmz=x8-cmz
    *fly propnav=4
    *when time>169.9662752399384 stop
*end
